# 🛡️ Women Safety App

A smart women safety mobile application designed to improve personal safety through **real-time location tracking, emergency SOS alerts, community-driven reporting, and an offline-first architecture**. The project aims to provide immediate assistance during emergencies while helping users identify and avoid unsafe areas.

---

# 📖 Project Overview

The Women Safety App addresses the limitations of traditional safety applications by focusing on both **prevention** and **emergency response**.

The application provides users with:

- Real-time location tracking
- One-tap SOS emergency alerts
- Live location sharing through SMS
- Community-based unsafe area reporting
- Interactive Google Maps integration
- Offline functionality using local storage
- AI-powered risk prediction *(planned)*

---

# 🎯 Problem Statement

Many existing women safety applications depend heavily on internet connectivity and primarily react after an emergency occurs. They provide limited preventive assistance and lack community-driven safety intelligence.

Our solution aims to:

- Improve emergency response
- Increase awareness of unsafe locations
- Support users even in low-network environments
- Build a collaborative safety ecosystem

