# 💾 Offline-First Architecture

The application is designed to continue functioning even when internet connectivity is unavailable.

When offline:

- SOS remains accessible
- Emergency contacts remain available
- Data is stored locally using Hive *(planned)*
- Pending data automatically synchronizes with Firebase once connectivity is restored *(planned)*

